D[90913]={"^Ensures the balance of power between the members of the Illidari Council%. Equalizes health between all council members%.%s*$","Asegurao equilíbrio de poder entre os membros do Conselho Illidari. Iguala a vida de todos membros do Conselho."}
D[90914]={"^Playfully strikes the target, dealing (.-) damage and stunning them for (.-)%.%s*$","Golpeia o alvo alegremente, causa {{1}} de dano e o atordoa durante {{2}}."}
