D[91292]={"^Imbue the caster's weapon with fire, granting each hit a (.-)%% chance to cause additional Fire damage%.%s*$","Imbui o arma do conjurador com Fogo, concedendo a cada golpe {{1}}% de chance de causar dano de Fogo adicional."}
