D[92030]={"^Open within the center of the lumbermill at New Hearthglen to unleash the termites and draw out Foreman Kaleiki%.%s*$","Abrir no centro do serraria de Nova Vega do Amparo para soltar as termitas e fazer sair ao supervisor Kaleiki."}
D[92031]={"^Increases the critical effect chance of your Swiftmend and Nourish spells by (.-)%%%.%s*$","Aumenta a chance defeito crítico de seus feitiços Alívio veloz e Nutrir {{1}}%."}
